   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Barnmorskeutbildning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Midwife training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(KI), Sweden, to the Poli Technical Health Institute (POLISAL) of the National Autonomous University of Nicaragua (UNAN), and the obstetric nursing schools administered by MINSA. MINSA/POLISAL are responsible for the administration and organisation of the project.The project was integrated in sector support 62000310 by May 2008.Technical Assistance by KI still in 62000385603/CZB 090414.Last phase 62000467.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">In December 2004, the Embassy of Sweden decided (decision 170/04) to support the project &quot;Training of obstetric nurses in Nicaragua&quot; for the period 2004-2009. Sweden has entered into Agreement with Nicaragua for this purpose. The total contribution is SEK 27 000 000 for the project period, which includes the support of technical assistance by the Karolinska Institute.</narrative>
  </description>
